### Create a task with all fields
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pay rent",
  "dueDate": "2026-07-31",
  "category": "home"
}

> {% client.global.set("taskId", response.body.id); %}

### Create a task with only a title
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Read a book"
}

### List all tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks

### List tasks filtered by category
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks?category=home

### Get a task by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/{{taskId}}

### Update a task (full replace) and mark it completed
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/{{taskId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pay rent",
  "dueDate": "2026-07-31",
  "category": "home",
  "completed": true
}

### Delete a task
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/{{taskId}}

### Error example: blank title is rejected with 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "  "
}

### Error example: unknown id returns 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/tasks/does-not-exist
